197
00:16:20,320 --> 00:16:31,920
So at that point you were at a place where you felt like more capital would improve the business more quickly and like you needed capital but you didn't necessarily need to go down that VC path.

198
00:16:32,880 --> 00:16:37,520
And I read about this crowdfunding but actually didn't go deep enough to know exactly what you did.

